  "body": "A rare opportunity has arrived in the heart of Orewa's fast-growing Strathmill community. Modern, stylish, and designed for effortless everyday living, the home delivers the perfect balance of comfort, convenience, and contemporary design. Set on approximately 279 sqm of land with an approximately 96.79 sqm floor area, the home offers three well-sized bedrooms and two elegant bathrooms. Whether you're stepping onto the property ladder, upgrading your lifestyle, downsizing with ease, or securing a smart investment, these homes tick every box.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area forms the welcoming heart of the home, designed to offer both comfort and effortless everyday living. The contemporary kitchen features quality appliances, sleek cabinetry, generous bench space, and a practical wraparound layout that provides excellent functionality while keeping everything within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFlowing seamlessly from the living area, large sliding doors open out to an expansive deck and a beautifully sized private garden - creating the perfect setting for entertaining, family gatherings, summer BBQs, or simply relaxing outdoors in complete privacy. \r\n\r\nThe spacious master suite offers a quiet and comfortable retreat, featuring a stylish ensuite and ample wardrobe space for everyday convenience. Two further well-proportioned bedrooms are serviced by a beautifully appointed family bathroom.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\nSingle internal-access garage\r\nHeat Pump\r\nCable for EV Charger\r\n\r\nPositioned within the fast-growing Strathmill community, this home enjoys a peaceful modern setting surrounded by quality new homes and a welcoming neighbourhood atmosphere. Offering the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and easy living, it is an ideal choice for families, professionals, downsizers, or investors looking to enjoy the best of contemporary Orewa living.\r\n\r\nMove straight in and enjoy the lifestyle, location, and value that these exceptional new homes have to offer.\r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing.",
